          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ukafwa uko na wughosi ghuboie, wa matuku mengi, ufughie, uko na ishima; na mwana wake Solomoni ukabonya nguma wulalo ghwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mabonyo gha Mzuri Daudi kufuma kuzoya hata kutua ghaandikilo chuonyi cha Malagho gha Ngelo cha mlodi Samueli, na gha Malagho gha Ngelo cha mlodi Nathani, na cha Malagho gha Ngelo cha mlodi Gadi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "viko na mtalo ghose ghwa kubonya nguma kwake, na kudima kwake, na maza rose reremchieghe uo na Waisraeli, na mawuzuri ghose gha masanga ghiko mbai mbai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.30",
